  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Protection and Socio-Economic Integration of Migrants in Vulnerable Situations in Morocco</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM Morocco seeks to contribute to improving migration management in Morocco through an enhanced protection system that will respond to the immediate needs of migrants in terms of health care services, food, clothing, and shelter, and the socio-economic integration of migrants through the promotion of employability and income generating activities.</narrative>
  </description>
